<h2><span data-i18n="review.common.overview">Overview</span></h2>
<p>Claude is Anthropic's advanced AI assistant, known for its exceptional reasoning abilities, nuanced understanding, and industry-leading coding capabilities. Founded by former OpenAI researchers focused on AI safety, Anthropic has built Claude to be helpful, harmless, and honest.</p>
<p>What sets Claude apart is its remarkable ability to handle complex, multi-step tasks while maintaining context across extremely long conversations. With a 200,000 token context window (the largest among mainstream AI assistants), Claude can analyze entire codebases, long documents, and extensive conversation histories without losing track of important details.</p>
<p>The latest Claude 3.5 Sonnet model has topped coding benchmarks and developer satisfaction surveys, making it the go-to choice for software engineers and technical professionals. Features like Artifacts (for code preview and document creation) and Projects (for organized workspace with persistent context) make Claude uniquely suited for professional work.</p>
